<lb n="20"/>gehandiget worden, und was hingegen daran
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beÿ</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eüch</unclear> noch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verhanden</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">seÿn</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">moechte</unclear>, nit wenig
